      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SKY FALCON (3) goes very well this trip starting seven times for three wins and two minors. Scored by 4.5 lengths last time (21.91) in a Mix 6/7 over 390m at Shepparton. Expected to go close. LEKTRA BILLS (1) could manage only second last time but ran respectable time (23.18) at Horsham over 410m when beaten 4.5 lengths in a Grade 4. Bold showing expected again. SAVE ME GARY (7) shapes well for this on his lightning win a few runs back, getting around Horsham over 410m in 22.90 then hitting the frame in both runs since. Smart winner three back and looks a key chance on that form. URGING (2) is worth some thought after showing speed and filling a placing last start.",
